<body>
<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>How SokoYetu Mtaani Works</h1>
    <p>A simple guide for browsing products, checking seller stores, paying safely, tracking orders and getting support.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main-content">
  <section class="card">
    <div class="head">Buyer journey</div>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="step"><span class="number">1</span><b>Browse products</b><span>Start from the homepage, categories page or seller stores page. Compare product details, prices, stock and descriptions before ordering.</span></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="number">2</span><b>Review product details</b><span>Open product details to confirm the item, seller, price, description and stock status before you proceed.</span></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="number">3</span><b>Add to cart</b><span>Use the shop flow to add the product to your cart and confirm your order information.</span></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="number">4</span><b>Checkout with M-PESA</b><span>Confirm the prompt amount before entering your M-PESA PIN and keep your confirmation receipt.</span></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="number">5</span><b>Track your order</b><span>Use your order ID and checkout phone number to follow the order status.</span></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="number">6</span><b>Get support</b><span>If there is a payment, delivery, product or refund issue, submit a support request with your evidence.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="linkbtn" href="/categories.html">Browse categories</a>
        <a class="linkbtn secondary" href="/seller-stores.html">View seller stores</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <div class="head">What to check before ordering</div>
    <div class="body">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>What to confirm</th><th>Why it matters</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Product</td><td>Name, image, description, category and stock status.</td><td>Helps reduce wrong-product or unclear-listing issues.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Price</td><td>Order total and any delivery or extra charges shown during checkout.</td><td>Helps you compare the checkout amount with the M-PESA prompt.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Phone</td><td>The phone number used for checkout and M-PESA confirmation.</td><td>It may be needed for order tracking and support review.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Delivery</td><td>Delivery address, contact details and availability.</td><td>Helps avoid failed or delayed delivery.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Support evidence</td><td>Order ID, M-PESA receipt, amount paid and product name.</td><td>Helps support investigate faster if something goes wrong.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <div class="head">Payment and order tracking</div>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="warnBox">If you receive an M-PESA receipt but the order still appears pending, do not pay again immediately. Keep the receipt and submit a support request.</div>
      <div class="grid">
        <a class="tile" href="/checkout.html"><b>Checkout</b><span>Review cart and payment flow.</span><em class="pill">payment</em></a>
        <a class="tile" href="/track-order.html"><b>Track order</b><span>Check order progress using order ID and phone.</span><em class="pill">tracking</em></a>
        <a class="tile" href="/support-request.html"><b>Support request</b><span>Submit payment, delivery, product or refund issues.</span><em class="pill">support</em></a>
        <a class="tile" href="/trust-center.html"><b>Trust Center</b><span>Read buyer safety and M-PESA guidance.</span><em class="pill">safety</em></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <div class="head">Frequently asked questions</div>
    <div class="body">
      <details>
        <summary>Can I contact a seller directly to pay?</summary>
        <p>Use the SokoYetu Mtaani checkout flow where possible. Be cautious with requests to pay outside the website or send money to personal numbers.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What should I do after payment?</summary>
        <p>Keep your order ID, checkout phone number and M-PESA confirmation message until the order is completed.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Where do I report a delivery or product issue?</summary>
        <p>Use the Support Request page and include the order ID, product name, issue type and any payment evidence.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

